% Quantum music literature, citation-closed working bibliography
% Scope: scholarly papers/chapters whose subject is quantum physics or quantum
% computation applied to music, musical composition, sound, or musicology.
% Excludes papers where MUSIC is only an acronym (e.g. quantum sensing).
% Coverage audit: ISQCMC proceedings (2023 and 2025/2026), the Springer
% Quantum Computer Music volume, the QuTune research index, and citation-
% followed foundational and direct quantum-music papers. This is a bounded
% scholarly inventory, not a claim that every future or adjacent publication
% using the label "quantum music" has been found.
% Recursion additions were checked against the field review, the Springer
% sound-representation chapter, and the reference list of Quantum Vocal Theory.
% `citesquantummusic` records in-scope outgoing citation edges found while
% reading the papers; entries with an empty value are roots in this map.

@article{dallaChiara2015QuantumInformation,
